{# The wiki's brand: what `PageTitre` used to hold (ticket 30).

   One <a> to the home page, carrying a logo, a name, or both -- `mode` says which and
   where, because a logo beside a name and a logo above it are different designs and
   picking one is a decision rather than a fallback (LayoutService::BRAND_MODES).

   The mode is on the element as a class as well, so a theme can restyle any of the four
   without needing to know which fields the wiki filled in. #}
<a class="navbar-brand yw-brand yw-brand--{{ mode }}" href="{{ home }}">
  {% if mode != 'text' and logo %}
    {# alt is the title, not "logo": read aloud, this link is the wiki's name #}
    <img class="yw-brand__logo" src="{{ logo }}" alt="{{ title }}">
  {% endif %}
  {% if mode != 'logo' %}
    <span class="yw-brand__title">{{ title }}</span>
  {% endif %}
</a>
